    {
      "field": "Study 5 respiratory context",
      "source": "Derived from the repository canonical Study 5 profile: original 4-second inhale/exhale clips, Study 5 row order, pre/post run structure, catch family, and stationary-burst baseline workflow are preserved for the local lab context."
    },
    {
      "field": "DynaSpace stimulus timing",
      "source": "The smartphone validation profile encodes 3.85 s DynaSpace audio, 105 ms pre-hold, 2.945 s movement, 0.8 s post-hold, 640-to-20 cm approach, and tactile anchors at 105/1625/2385/2765/2955/3050 ms."
    },
    {
      "field": "trajectory orientation",
      "source": "This local variant creates source-level left -45 degree and right +45 degree approach snapshots so Segment 4 can balance half of trials to each side."
    },
    {
      "field": "baseline comparator",
      "source": "The DynaSpace fixed 640 cm comparator is implemented as Study 5 stationary_burst baseline files generated from each left/right source snapshot, preserving fixed instruction audio and matched tactile anchors."
    },
    {
      "field": "public asset policy",
      "source": "The original Android bursttrain WAVs are not redistributed; the profile uses PPS Toolkit generated DynaSpace-style Gaussian white-noise burst trains rendered through the bundled FABIAN/SOFA path."
    },
    {
      "field": "trial budget",
      "source": "Segment 4 repetitions use audio-tactile 5.0, baseline 2.5, and catch 6.0 to keep the Study 5 204-row total while adding the six DynaSpace tactile anchors and preserving balanced inhale/exhale and left/right counts."
    }
  ],
  "notes": "This manifest audits recreation inside the PPS Toolkit GUI. It distinguishes toolkit-generated recreations of reported parameters from the original authors' exact stimulus set."
